Description: open-bamboo-networking - open-source Bambu Studio network plugin
 Drop-in, open-source replacement for the proprietary bambu_networking
 plugin that Bambu Studio and Orca Slicer download on first start. Same
 C ABI and file names, so LAN printing, MQTT status, camera and cloud
 login work without the closed binary.
 .
 This package stages upstream's Linux aarch64 release archive under
 /usr/lib/obn, unmodified. The plugin itself lives in each user's slicer
 config directory, so after installing run "obn-install" as your normal
 user with the slicer closed; it runs upstream's installer, which detects
 Bambu Studio (native or Flatpak) or Orca Slicer, picks the matching ABI
 build, copies the libraries and patches the slicer conf exactly as the
 upstream README describes.

